<title>TANZANIA: SOCCER-TANZANIA BEAT TOGO 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TANZANIA BEAT TOGO 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanzania beat Togo 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in an Africa Nations Cup group six qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Willforce Amlima 31</p>
<p>Attendance 10,000.</p>
</text>
